<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Cero no es la meta.</h1><p class="pc-lead">El potencial se explora individualmente, no se calcula a partir de la diferencia.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Satisfacción personal: 0 = ninguna, 10 = completa. No es una escala clínica.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Físico</p><h3>Movimiento y comodidad</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Actual</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Deseado</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Sin determinar</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Cognitivo</p><h3>Atención</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Actual</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">Deseado</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Sin determinar</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Emocional</p><h3>Calma y facilidad</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">Actual</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">Deseado</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Sin determinar</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Profesional</p><h3>Recursos laborales</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">Actual</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">Deseado</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Sin evaluar</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potencial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Sin determinar</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">El potencial se explora individualmente, no se calcula a partir de la diferencia.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Restablecer</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Guardar en el dispositivo</button></div><p class="pc-note">Sin transferencia automática; exportación JSON local.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Hablar de tu situación</a></div></section></main>